        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Discharge and odour almost resolved, with mildly increased clear discharge only. No itch, pain, dyspareunia, dysuria, or pelvic pain. Genitourinary examination not repeated today because symptoms improved and time was limited."
      }
    },
    {
